:SPEAKER Dithon
Hello Arda. I am impressed you made it this far.
But I am afraid thee is one last challenge for you.
You see, this game is called daemon garden because it has DAEMONS in it.
And you will have to fight plenty of them! {
    ?: Daemons? (Show Tutorial) \ What are daemons?
        Daemons are the spirits that populate this realm. Some friendly, many not.
        By the sound of it, you won't know how to fight them either. I'll make sure to throw a tutorial in for you.
        :YIELD battle:with_tutorial
        # battle sets outcome...
        [branch]
            [when:outcome=victory]
                Wow, nice job. I'm impressed.
            [when:outcome=failure]
                Too bad! Speak to me again if you want another try.
            [when:outcome=draw]
                Draw. In a real fight that would still count as a loss.
            [unless:outcome]
                What.
        [/branch]

    ?: Go ahead \ Go ahead, I've already forsaken plenty of daemons.
        Impressive! I won't waste your time then.
        :YIELD battle
        # battle sets outcome
        [branch]
            [when:outcome=victory]
                Wow, nice job. As expected.
            [when:outcome=failure]
                Wow you suck. I thought you knew what you were doing!
            [when:outcome=draw]
                Draw. In a real fight that would still count as a loss.
            [unless:outcome]
                What.
        [/branch]
}
That's it for the demo. Thanks for playing!